动模式、任务完成时间及潜在的资源分配需求。",1\n5,OBSTACLE_DISTANCE,"<think>\nOkay, let\'s tackle this. The user wants me to generate a concise description in Chinese for the entity ""OBSTACLE_DISTANCE"" based on the given descriptions. The descriptions mention that it\'s about the distance between an agent and the nearest obstacle. \n\nFirst, I need to make sure I understand the task. The user provided two descriptions that are essentially the same, both stating that OBSTACLE_DISTANCE represents the distance from the agent to the nearest obstacle. Since there\'s no contradiction here, I can combine them into a single coherent summary.\n\nThe key points to include are the entity name, the definition, and any relevant context from the nearby text. The original data mentions ""代理"" (agent) and ""障碍物"" (obstacle), so I should use those terms. Also, the descriptions are in Chinese, so the output needs to be in Chinese as well.\n\nI should check if there\'s any additional information from the nearby text that might be relevant. The user mentioned that if no answer is possible or the description is empty, I should only convey the provided info. Since there\'s enough info here, I can proceed.\n\nNow, structuring the response: Start with the entity name, then explain what it represents, and maybe mention its purpose in the system. Since the original descriptions are straightforward, the summary should be clear and concise. Make sure to use third person and include the entity name as specified.\n</think>\n\nOBSTACLE_DISTANCE 是一个用于表征代理（Agent）与最近障碍物之间距离的数据指标，其数值反映了代理在移动或操作过程中与周围环境中的障碍物的相对位置关系。该数据通过实时监测代理与障碍物的间距，为路径规划、避障决策及安全距离评估提供关键依据，是自动化系统中保障操作安全性和效率的重要参数。其描述内容在不同表述中保持一致，均指向代理与障碍物的动态空间关系分析。",1\n32,BATTERY,电池实体，记录无人机的剩余电量},1\n34,_ID,,1\n\n\n-----Relationships-----\nhuman_readable_id,source,target,description,rank\n12,AGENT,TASK,"<think>\nOkay, let\'s tackle this. The user wants me to generate a concise Chinese description of the entities ""AGENT"" and ""TASK"" based on the provided descriptions. T