l perception data), ""避障决策"" (collision avoidance decision), and ""路径规划"" (path planning). Make sure it\'s in third person and concise. \n\nDouble-check for any contradictions. Both descriptions agree on the use of obstacle distance data for collision avoidance and path planning. So the summary should reflect that. \n\nNow, translate that into Chinese, ensuring clarity and proper grammar. Avoid any markdown and keep it natural.\n</think>\n\n在智能系统中，""AGENT""（智能体）通过采集""OBSTACLE_DISTANCE""（障碍物距离）作为环境感知数据，实现对周围障碍物的实时监测。该数据不仅用于动态避障决策，还作为路径规划的核心输入参数，通过算法计算最优行进路线，确保智能体在",17\n15,AGENT,BATTERY,无人机的电池剩余电量反映其续航能力,17\n21,AGENT,_ID,数据记录的唯一标识符与无人机实体关联,17\n\nOutput:'}
